Revert arm of scripts/demo/d440a-m0-check.sh (#462): the UE keeps its start
position (no sim_route), so its route never starts, it stays camped on gnb-west
while CM-IDLE and never reselects to gnb-east, and the check must fail at ue
step 4/9 (`Simulated motion started`).

  scripts/demo/revert-run.sh --expect "[ue] step 4/9 missing" \
      scripts/demo/reverts/d440a-m0-ue-stays-put.patch -- scripts/demo/d440a-m0-check.sh

diff --git a/config/ue-d440a-m0.yaml b/config/ue-d440a-m0.yaml
index e19956c..2b700cf 100644
--- a/config/ue-d440a-m0.yaml
+++ b/config/ue-d440a-m0.yaml
@@ -110,12 +110,6 @@ gnb_search_list:
